WEBVTT

00:10:59.894 --> 00:11:01.824
with my engineers

00:11:01.824 --> 00:11:04.704
and we work on building new things.

00:11:04.704 --> 00:11:08.174
I think that's the most important thing
that I love to do.

00:11:08.174 --> 00:11:10.634
SRK: Sundar still likes innovation more,

00:11:10.634 --> 00:11:14.124
though managerial and strategic
planning keep going on.

00:11:17.214 --> 00:11:20.434
It's not more serious 
but stems from this only,

00:11:20.434 --> 00:11:24.124
are you constantly innovating or trying
to beat the competition?

00:11:24.124 --> 00:11:25.444
You have to do both,

00:11:25.444 --> 00:11:29.104
I understand that and respect that, 
when you are heading a company like this,

00:11:29.104 --> 00:11:30.564
you are the CEO of Google.